<title>NETHERLANDS: Pirelli Tyre 1996 net profit NLG 96.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Pirelli Tyre 1996 net profit NLG 96.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  5.64 vs   5.32</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   341.1  vs 271.5</p>
<p>    Net profit			    96.6  vs  41.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Pirelli Tyre Holding NV is an Amsterdam- listed unit of Italy's Pirelli SpA. Pirelli SpA launched a bid for the Pirelli Tyre shares it did not already own in January and has since raised its stake in Pirelli Tyre to 99.53 percent. Pirelli Tyre will be delisted from the Amsterdam bourse in June.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
